---
title: CMN Request Data Flow
---
sequenceDiagram
    actor User
    participant Client as Frontend<br/>(Web/Mobile)
    participant GW as Web Gateway<br/>(YARP)
    participant AdminAPI as Administration API
    participant CustAPI as Customer API
    participant DB as SQL Server
    participant Redis
    participant Cloudinary

    %% Auth flow
    Note over User,Redis: Authentication Flow
    User->>Client: Enter credentials (Employee.Code + password) + X-Tenant header
    Client->>GW: POST /cmn/administration-service/api/auth
    GW->>AdminAPI: Forward request
    AdminAPI->>DB: Find Employee by Code → IdentityUser by UserId
    AdminAPI->>Redis: SET {userId}:{sessionId} = refreshToken TTL 720h
    AdminAPI-->>Client: LoginOutputDto { AccessToken, RefreshToken, IsFirstLogin }
    Client->>Client: cookie.set(ACCESS_TOKEN_KEY, accessToken)
    Client->>Client: cookie.set(REFRESH_TOKEN_KEY, refreshToken)
    Client->>Client: localStorage.set(tenantId)

    %% Authenticated request
    Note over User,DB: Authenticated Request Flow
    User->>Client: Action (e.g., view employees)
    Client->>GW: GET /cmn/administration-service/api/employees<br/>Authorization: Bearer {token}<br/>X-Tenant: {tenantId}
    GW->>AdminAPI: Forward (path: /cmn/administration-service/api/employees)
    AdminAPI->>AdminAPI: CMNAbpExceptionFilter validates
    AdminAPI->>DB: IRepository<Employee> query (scoped to TenantId)
    DB-->>AdminAPI: Employee records
    AdminAPI-->>Client: ApiResult<PagedResult<EmployeeOutputDto>>

    %% Cross-service gRPC
    Note over CustAPI,AdminAPI: Cross-Service Permission Check (gRPC)
    User->>Client: Action on Customer API
    Client->>GW: GET /cmn/customer-management/api/parties
    GW->>CustAPI: Forward
    CustAPI->>AdminAPI: gRPC CheckPermission(userId, key)
    AdminAPI-->>CustAPI: { allowed: true }
    CustAPI->>DB: Query Party data
    CustAPI-->>Client: ApiResult<PagedResult<PartyOutputDto>>

    %% Media upload
    Note over User,Cloudinary: Media Upload Flow
    User->>Client: Select file
    Client->>GW: POST /cmn/administration-service/api/media-files (FormData)
    GW->>AdminAPI: Forward
    AdminAPI->>Cloudinary: Upload file
    Cloudinary-->>AdminAPI: { publicId, secureUrl, assetId, ... }
    AdminAPI->>DB: Save MediaFile entity
    AdminAPI-->>Client: ApiResult<MediaFileOutputDto>
